{
  "__metadata": {
    "folder": "applications"
  },
  "dashboard": {
    "uid": "dk-data-fe-hydration-backlog",
    "title": "dk-data Hydration Backlog (DLQ)",
    "description": "Hydration dead-letter queue (meta.hydration_backlog) + quarantine telemetry. Plan.md \u00a7C.3. Reads dk_hydration_dlq_added_total / dk_hydration_dlq_quarantined_total / dk_hydration_dlq_skipped_total from the prestaged dispatcher; latest-row panel reads meta.hydration_backlog via the postgres datasource.",
    "tags": [
      "dk-data-fe",
      "hydration",
      "dlq",
      "observability"
    ],
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "editable": true,
    "refresh": "1m",
    "time": {
      "from": "now-24h",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "timepicker": {},
    "timezone": "",
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "name": "source",
          "type": "query",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refresh": 2,
          "query": "label_values(dk_hydration_dlq_added_total, source)",
          "includeAll": true,
          "multi": true,
          "allValue": ".*",
          "current": {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "All",
            "value": "$__all"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "annotations": {
      "list": []
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "DLQ failures (last 24h)",
        "description": "Total hydration failures recorded to meta.hydration_backlog in the last 24 hours, summed across sources. Dashboard-side approximation \u2014 the counter dk_hydration_dlq_added_total increments on every failure, not only on first-time inserts.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 8,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
                { "color": "orange", "value": 10 },
                { "color": "red", "value": 50 }
              ]
            },
            "mappings": []
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(dk_hydration_dlq_added_total{source=~\"$source\"}[24h]))",
            "legendFormat": "failures_24h",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Quarantine events (last 24h)",
        "description": "Count of source quarantine transitions in the last 24 hours. Each event is a one-shot increment \u2014 a source can quarantine, be unquarantined by the operator CLI, then re-enter quarantine on the next failure (two events).",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 8,
          "x": 8,
          "y": 0
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
              ]
            },
            "mappings": []
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(dk_hydration_dlq_quarantined_total{source=~\"$source\"}[24h]))",
            "legendFormat": "quarantined_24h",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Skipped steps (last 24h)",
        "description": "Hydration steps skipped because the source was quarantined. Elevated skip counts without new quarantine events mean a quarantine has been outstanding too long \u2014 operator must investigate and either fix the source or run `--unquarantine`.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 8,
          "x": 16,
          "y": 0
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                { "color": "green", "value": null },
                { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
                { "color": "orange", "value": 50 }
              ]
            },
            "mappings": []
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "background",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(dk_hydration_dlq_skipped_total{source=~\"$source\"}[24h]))",
            "legendFormat": "skipped_24h",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "DLQ failures added per hour by source",
        "description": "Rate of hydration failures recorded to meta.hydration_backlog, broken down by source. A sustained non-zero rate from a single source is the leading indicator of a quarantine event.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 9,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 4
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineInterpolation": "linear",
              "fillOpacity": 10
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(dk_hydration_dlq_added_total{source=~\"$source\"}[1h]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Quarantine events",
        "description": "Increase in dk_hydration_dlq_quarantined_total over a 24h window, per source. A spike here is a ticketed event \u2014 the DkHydrationSourceQuarantined PrometheusRule pages on-call. Use this panel to visually confirm the alert fired for the source you expect.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 9,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 4
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "bars",
              "lineInterpolation": "linear",
              "fillOpacity": 60
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "calcs": ["sum", "max"]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (source) (increase(dk_hydration_dlq_quarantined_total{source=~\"$source\"}[24h]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Skipped-due-to-quarantine (rate)",
        "description": "Dispatcher skips per second, per source. A sustained non-zero rate means a quarantine has been outstanding long enough that scheduled hydration runs are repeatedly no-oping the source. The DkHydrationDlqSkipRate PrometheusRule alerts on this.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 9,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 13
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ops",
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineInterpolation": "linear",
              "fillOpacity": 10
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(dk_hydration_dlq_skipped_total{source=~\"$source\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "type": "table",
        "title": "Current backlog (meta.hydration_backlog)",
        "description": "Latest backlog rows per (source, schema, table) with failure signature, last_error excerpt, and quarantine state. Sourced directly from meta.hydration_backlog via the postgres datasource. If the postgres datasource isn't provisioned in this Grafana instance, the panel shows `No data` \u2014 counter-based panels above still work.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "postgres"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 10,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 22
        },
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "custom": {
              "align": "left"
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "showHeader": true,
          "footer": {
            "show": false,
            "reducer": ["sum"],
            "fields": ""
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "rawSql": "SELECT source, schema_name, table_name, failure_count, failure_signature, LEFT(last_error, 200) AS last_error, quarantined, last_attempt_at FROM meta.hydration_backlog ORDER BY last_attempt_at DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 100",
            "format": "table",
            "rawQuery": true,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Operator notes",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 32
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "### What this dashboard shows\n\n- **Stat row**: 24h totals for failures added, quarantine events, and skipped steps.\n- **Timeseries**: failure rate, quarantine events, and skip rate \u2014 each broken down by `source`.\n- **Current backlog table**: latest rows from `meta.hydration_backlog` (requires a `postgres` datasource; falls back to `No data` otherwise).\n\n### How to un-quarantine a source\n\nAfter fixing the underlying cause (e.g. upstream dump now valid, credentials rotated), clear the quarantine with the prestaged CLI:\n\n```\npython -m dk_data.ingestion.prestaged --unquarantine <source>\n```\n\nThis clears the `quarantined` flag in `meta.hydration_backlog` so the next dispatcher run will re-attempt the source. Failures that recur re-quarantine automatically.\n\nSee `docs/runbooks/` for the full DLQ / quarantine playbook (plan \u00a7C.3)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
